{"unit_id":"tag:08XA:statement","translation":"以下条件等价（equivalent）。\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<ITEMOPEN_0001>(a)<ITEMCLOSE_0001> 态射（morphism）<MATH_0001>是模（modules）的下降（descent）态射（morphism）。\n<ITEMOPEN_0002>(b)<ITEMCLOSE_0002> 态射（morphism）<MATH_0002>是模（modules）的有效的下降（descent）态射（morphism）。\n<ITEMOPEN_0003>(c)<ITEMCLOSE_0003> 态射（morphism）<MATH_0003>普遍为单射（injective）。\n<STRUCT_0002>\n","allowed_english":["a","b","c"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"equivalent","target_term":"等价"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"descent","target_term":"下降"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"descent","target_term":"下降"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"单射"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"equivalent","target_term":"等价","context":"等价条件；待批准。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"环映射与下降态射；待批准。"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模","context":"模的下降；待批准。"},{"source_term":"descent","target_term":"下降","context":"下降态射及有效下降态射；待批准。"},{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"单射","context":"普遍单射条件；待批准。"}],"notes":[]}
